1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,300
Can you get that page into the record?

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,400
After your plea. The names stay covered.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,800
How's your back?

4
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,400
I'll be okay. Just don't lose that page.

5
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,100
Mr. Mangione, can you hear me clearly?

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,500
Yes, Your Honor.

7
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:48,700
How do you plead to the charges before this court?

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,500
Not guilty, Your Honor.

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,200
We request the full arrest recordings, including the period before the backpack was opened.

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,310
The defense has the inventory. What else are you asking for?

11
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:16,100
The recordings. A list tells us what was logged, not what happened before that.

12
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:19,150
Put the missing material in your request.

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,700
Some entries copy patient records. We need to distinguish those from his own statements.

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,800
That requires a written motion.

15
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,700
File it in writing. Redact the patients' names. Today we're setting the schedule.

16
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:06,700
That color's back in stock. Link below. It'll ship before the next hearing.

17
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:09,100
Were you inside?

18
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,300
Can you move?

19
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:19,300
Hang on, the lawyer's coming out. Size chart's down below.

20
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,300
Anything thrown out today?

21
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:30,300
Nothing. We've asked for the arrest recordings. We don't have them yet.

22
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,300
Can we run this?

23
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:51,300
Not yet. This box is blank. I don't know what should be in it.

24
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,700
Get the sweater clip done first. Then follow this up.

25
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,800
Send me the clean audio.

26
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,960
The clip's due in ten.

27
00:03:07,260 --> 00:03:10,790
You'll have it. I'm not running the documents tonight.

28
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:24,800
I won't use your name. Someone could still figure it out. Do you want to meet?
